          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We categorize angles that are not right, straight, or full into three groups.</p>",
            "readable_text": "We categorize angles that are not right, straight, or full into three groups.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<ul><li><p>An <strong>acute angle</strong> has a measure between <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 0^\\circ]</span> and <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 90^\\circ\\mathbin{:}]</span></p><div class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/da96ee34aafe8dd3f89bff2f146ddcb2\"></div></li><li><p>An <strong>obtuse angle</strong> has a measure between <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 90^\\circ]</span> and  <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 180^\\circ\\mathbin{:}]</span></p><div class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/4b258aab2483422654b33317693edc24\"></div></li></ul>",
            "readable_text": "- An acute angle has a measure between [MATH: 0^\\circ] and [MATH: 90^\\circ\\mathbin{:}]\n\n[IMG: /graphics/da96ee34aafe8dd3f89bff2f146ddcb2]\n- An obtuse angle has a measure between [MATH: 90^\\circ] and [MATH: 180^\\circ\\mathbin{:}]\n\n[IMG: /graphics/4b258aab2483422654b33317693edc24]",
            "images": [
              {
                "src": "/graphics/da96ee34aafe8dd3f89bff2f146ddcb2",
                "alt": ""
              },
              {
                "src": "/graphics/4b258aab2483422654b33317693edc24",
                "alt": ""
              }
            ],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<ul><li><p>Angles whose measure is between <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 180^\\circ]</span> and <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 360^\\circ]</span> are called <strong>reflex angles</strong>.  </p><div class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/d52887cae6395f2c49e1538ab2f08cb6\"></div></li></ul>",
            "readable_text": "- Angles whose measure is between [MATH: 180^\\circ] and [MATH: 360^\\circ] are called reflex angles.\n\n[IMG: /graphics/d52887cae6395f2c49e1538ab2f08cb6]",
            "images": [
              {
                "src": "/graphics/d52887cae6395f2c49e1538ab2f08cb6",
