        "readable_text": "Content:\nWe categorize angles that are not right, straight, or full into three groups.\n\nContent:\n- An acute angle has a measure between [MATH: 0^\\circ] and [MATH: 90^\\circ\\mathbin{:}]\n\n[IMG: /graphics/da96ee34aafe8dd3f89bff2f146ddcb2]\n- An obtuse angle has a measure between [MATH: 90^\\circ] and [MATH: 180^\\circ\\mathbin{:}]\n\n[IMG: /graphics/4b258aab2483422654b33317693edc24]\n\nContent:\n- Angles whose measure is between [MATH: 180^\\circ] and [MATH: 360^\\circ] are called reflex angles.\n\n[IMG: /graphics/d52887cae6395f2c49e1538ab2f08cb6]"
